      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Things should definitely be much bigger and easier to find. It takes a minute or two to find where someone is located without getting confused by the new ui.\nNot everyone has vrc+ icons. Not everyone has anything on their bio. Profile pictures getting squished to the side and being almost just as small as the icon feels awkward. Including small buttons in the corners. The previous UI was way less cluttered. Other things to consider maybe? - Expandable bio, worlds tab.",
